silm:instances_papers_06_topology_jepa_chapters_flat_sections_01_thesis_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "01ThesisYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_06_topology_jepa_chapters_flat_sections_01_thesis_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In '01ThesisYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Topology Prediction as Ologic Diagram Recovery' the universal_mediator arrow witnesses the unique mediating morphism from the Mittens colimit to the VetCarePlan_77 cocone, witnessing universality of the colimit assembly; this typed leg is load-bearing for the thesis pipeline step of the topology-JEPA pipeline.; also, In 'Topology Prediction as Ologic Diagram Recovery' the vet_evidence_attachment arrow witnesses the vet record evidence morphism attaches the signature of Dr. Osei to the body-mass quality node within the body local hypothesis; this typed leg is load-bearing for the thesis pipeline step of the topology-JEPA pipeline." .
